<codeline><highlight class="normal">&lt;!--<sp/>ABOUT<sp/>THE<sp/>PROJECT<sp/>--&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>About<sp/>The<sp/>Project</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">![Screenshot](./docs/imgs/screenshot.png)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">GXTK<sp/>7<sp/>is<sp/>GXDE-OS&apos;s<sp/>QtQuick<sp/>UI<sp/>library<sp/>&amp;<sp/>style<sp/>plugin<sp/>that<sp/>mimics<sp/>Deepin&apos;s<sp/>DTK2Widget<sp/>library.<sp/>It<sp/>aims<sp/>to<sp/>bring<sp/>the<sp/>apperance<sp/>of<sp/>DTK2Widget<sp/>back<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>modern<sp/>Qt6<sp/>Quick<sp/>applications<sp/>without<sp/>need<sp/>of<sp/>DTK2Widget-Qt6<sp/>(I<sp/>also<sp/>made<sp/>that<sp/>library<sp/>but<sp/>I<sp/>really<sp/>want<sp/>to<sp/>retire<sp/>that)<sp/>library<sp/>or<sp/>any<sp/>Qt<sp/>private<sp/>libraries.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Currently,<sp/>GXTK7<sp/>is<sp/>still<sp/>in<sp/>early<sp/>development<sp/>stage.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Built<sp/>With</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>Qt6<sp/>Core</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>Qt6<sp/>Gui</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>Qt6<sp/>Qml</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>Qt6<sp/>Quick</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>Qt6<sp/>QuickControls2</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">&lt;!--<sp/>GETTING<sp/>STARTED<sp/>--&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Getting<sp/>Started</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Prerequisites</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">You<sp/>need<sp/>a<sp/>C++<sp/>compiler<sp/>supporting<sp/>C++17<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>Qt6<sp/>development<sp/>packages<sp/>installed<sp/>on<sp/>your<sp/>system.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>Qt6<sp/>(Core,<sp/>Gui,<sp/>Qml,<sp/>Quick,<sp/>QuickControls2)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>CMake<sp/>3.20<sp/>or<sp/>higher</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Installation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">####<sp/>Build<sp/>Manually</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">First,<sp/>create<sp/>a<sp/>build<sp/>directory<sp/>and<sp/>build<sp/>the<sp/>project:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```sh</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$<sp/>mkdir<sp/>build</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$<sp/>cd<sp/>build</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$<sp/>cmake<sp/>..</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$<sp/>make</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Then,<sp/>you<sp/>may<sp/>run<sp/>the<sp/>example:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```sh</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">./examples/gallery/gxde_gallery</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">####<sp/>Build<sp/>a<sp/>Debian<sp/>Package</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Install<sp/>the<sp/>build<sp/>dependencies,<sp/>then<sp/>build<sp/>the<sp/>binary<sp/>package<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>source<sp/>root:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```sh</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$<sp/>sudo<sp/>apt<sp/>build-dep<sp/>.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$<sp/>dpkg-buildpackage<sp/>-us<sp/>-uc<sp/>-b</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>produces<sp/>`qml6-module-qtquick-controls-gxde`,<sp/>which<sp/>installs<sp/>the<sp/>`QtQuick.Controls.Gxde`<sp/>module<sp/>into<sp/>the<sp/>system<sp/>Qt<sp/>QML<sp/>directory.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">&lt;!--<sp/>USAGE<sp/>EXAMPLES<sp/>--&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Usage</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Select<sp/>the<sp/>style<sp/>by<sp/>its<sp/>full<sp/>module<sp/>name,<sp/>either<sp/>in<sp/>C++:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```cpp</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">QQuickStyle::setStyle(&quot;QtQuick.Controls.Gxde&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">or<sp/>through<sp/>the<sp/>environment:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```sh</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$<sp/>QT_QUICK_CONTROLS_STYLE=QtQuick.Controls.Gxde<sp/>./your_app</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>`GxdeTheme`<sp/>singleton<sp/>(`import<sp/>QtQuick.Controls.Gxde`)<sp/>switches<sp/>between<sp/>the<sp/>light<sp/>and<sp/>dark<sp/>schemes<sp/>through<sp/>its<sp/>`isDark`<sp/>property.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">For<sp/>more,<sp/>please<sp/>refer<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>[widget<sp/>gallery<sp/>example](./examples/gallery/)<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>[documentation](./docs/).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
